 10+  9800              ; The driver is read-only: it never writes DS12887 registers.
 11+  9800              ; The gate is closed through the documented TR-DOS ROM trampoline and
 12+  9800              ; DOSEN/RG6 state is restored before returning.
 13+  9800              ;
 14+  9800              ; API:
 15+  9800              ;   P127_RTC_Init: probes Status D/A; A=1 available, A=0 unavailable,
 16+  9800              ;                  carry set when unavailable.
 17+  9800              ;   P127_RTC_ReadTime: A=hour (0..23), B=minute, C=second; carry on error.
 18+  9800              ;   P127_RTC_SelfTest: tests conversion vectors only; no hardware writes.
 19+  9800              ;
 20+  9800              ; DS12887 Status B selects BCD/binary and 12/24-hour formats.
